    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "uugh i hate doctors and the clinic is so expensive/takes forever. i had a tetanus shot like a few years ago (i think?), so am i not basically covered? can i just soak it in hydrogen peroxide and keep it covered with a band-aid? i don't want to spend the whole afternoon in a waiting room if i don't have to.",
